/*!
\page page_stEmcPoint StEmcPoint

\brief Reconstructed energy-deposition point in the STAR EMC, combining clusters from multiple sub-detectors.

\section emcpoint_overview Overview

StEmcPoint is the highest-level EMC reconstruction object.  It represents the
best estimate of where a single photon or electron deposited energy, formed by
combining shower clusters from up to four EMC sub-detectors (tower,
pre-shower, SMD-η/U, SMD-φ/V) into a single position measurement with
associated energy, χ², and track-residual information.

\section emcpoint_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StMeasuredPoint → StHit → StEmcPoint
\endcode

Points are stored in the \c StEmcPointCollection hanging off
\ref page_stEmcCollection "StEmcCollection".

\section emcpoint_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Float_t | mEnergy | Total energy [GeV]. |
| Float_t | mChiSquare | χ² of the point-fitting algorithm. |
| StThreeVectorF | mSize | Spatial shower-size vector. |
| Float_t[4] | mEnergyInDetector | Energy per sub-detector slot [GeV] (0=tower, 1=preshower, 2=SMD-η/U, 3=SMD-φ/V). |
| Float_t[4] | mSizeAtDetector | Transverse size at each sub-detector. |
| Float_t[2] | mDelta | Track residuals: [0]=Δη (ΔU), [1]=Δφ (ΔV). |
| StPtrVecEmcCluster[4] | mCluster | Cluster vectors, one per sub-detector slot. |
| StPtrVecEmcPoint | mNeighbors | Adjacent EMC points (non-owning). |
| StPtrVecTrack | mTracks | Matched tracks (non-owning). |
| int | myQuality | Reconstruction quality flag. |

\section emcpoint_methods Key Methods

- \c energy() — total energy [GeV].
- \c chiSquare() — reconstruction χ².
- \c size() — shower-size 3-vector.
- \c energyInDetector(StDetectorId) — energy in a specific sub-detector.
- \c sizeAtDetector(StDetectorId) — transverse size at a sub-detector.
- \c deltaEta(), \c deltaPhi() — track–point residuals.
- \c cluster(StDetectorId) — clusters from a sub-detector.
- \c addCluster(), \c addNeighbor(), \c addTrack() — population helpers.
- \c detector() — sub-detector ID.
- \c Print() — print summary to stdout.

\section emcpoint_seealso See Also

\ref page_stEmcCluster "StEmcCluster",
\ref page_stEmcRawHit "StEmcRawHit",
\ref page_stEmcDetector "StEmcDetector"
*/
